.vercel
.env*

# Agent and editor tooling, vendored from marketplaces rather than authored
# here. Both are ~3.2MB and re-installable, so they are noise in diffs and
# weight in every deploy: `vercel deploy` runs from this directory and respects
# this file, so ignoring them also trims the upload.
#
# Scoped to .claude/skills/ rather than all of .claude/, so any commands or
# settings this project actually authors can still be committed and shared.
.claude/skills/
.cursor/

# Impeccable critique snapshots. Generated reports, reproducible by re-running
# the command. Committing them would share score history across the team, which
# is a reasonable alternative: drop this line if that is wanted.
AllFire-Projects/.impeccable/
